{
  "about": "What importing an Excel model (step 20, docs/step20-excel-import.md) should find in each sample workbook. The samples are written by tools/make-import-samples.js; test group 78 checks this description against them. Kinds: title (a heading, no numbers), input (a typed number in every period), assumption (one typed number in column C, used by every period), calculation (a formula in every period), opening (a typed number in the first period, a formula in the others), single (one formula in column C, not by period). A row noted as not translated keeps Excel's saved values.",
